# Walkthrough: AI Humanizer & Detector

## Deployment Complete ✅

**Production:** https://writehubai.halal-solutions.com

**Access:** `/ai-tools`

---

## What Was Built

### 1. AI Detector
Analyzes text to determine if AI-generated.

**Metrics:**
- Burstiness (sentence length variation)
- Vocabulary diversity
- AI pattern detection (filler phrases)
- LLM analysis (50% weight)

**Scores:** Human % vs AI %

---

### 2. AI Humanizer
Rewrites AI text to sound human.

**5 Styles:**
| Style | Description |
|-------|-------------|
| Standard | Natural, conversational |
| Academic | Scholarly, formal |
| Simple | Easy to understand |
| Formal | Professional tone |
| Creative | Engaging, vivid |

**Freeze List:** Protect specific words from modification.

